@host = http://localhost:5238
@apiKey = pon-tu-api-key-aqui

### Webhook (publico, sin auth) - debe devolver el challenge tal cual
GET {{host}}/api/v1/WebHookMessages?hub.mode=subscribe&hub.challenge=1234567890&hub.verify_token=12345

###

### Enviar plantilla
POST {{host}}/api/v1/SendTemplateMessage
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "5215512345678",
  "templateName": "compra_aprobada",
  "parameters": [
    { "type": "text", "parameterName": "nombre", "text": "Juan" }
  ]
}

###

### Listar API keys (requiere admin)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ApiKeys
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

###

### Crear API key (requiere admin)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/ApiKeys
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cliente-x",
  "isAdmin": false,
  "expiresAt": null
}

###

### Revocar API key (requiere admin)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/ApiKeys/1
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}

###

### Rotar Access Token de WhatsApp (requiere admin)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/WhatsAppAccessToken
X-API-KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accessToken": "nuevo-token-aqui"
}
